{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2cd0c304ad75097fcec2ecfbe9017e5d4e54854609b096e2acaa239f53237a43", "ja": "（初ステージが終わった後、今後の活動方針を\n決めるため、琴葉に時間を作ってもらった）", "zh": "（第一次舞台演出结束后，为了决定今后的活动方针，请琴叶抽出了一些时间。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "413bb9ca456cc68234efe5226aab2406391b9581f39e05a9e804eb73d17e0a57", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nなんだか、学校の面談みたいですね。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n总觉得像是在学校面谈一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "c70a478747c0c3263740b51c71b3c3ae3777bb9112ba186898edbadb5a8a0d17", "ja": "ちょっと緊張しますけど……\n今日は、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "虽然有点紧张……\n今天还请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1003_p", "source_sha256": "46d1365b31ab21b0c3333f84c0bbfa6f669118e7411b44b4a9cc47ec7ef53974", "ja": "そんなに堅苦しい感じじゃないけどな。\n琴葉、劇場には慣れたか？", "zh": "没那么拘谨啦。\n琴叶，你已经习惯剧场了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "9532455eefc45b0b923a7cd3cffac618f8e1b1429edebfe24740445a87b30aa6", "ja": "はい。みんなとも、少しずつ仲良くなってこられたと\n思います。レッスンで話す機会も多いですし……。", "zh": "嗯。我觉得自己也在一点一点地和大家熟悉起来了。平时上课时也有很多聊天的机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "26a58c2bdf2ee26e2f96c667311b38abc713b4c3e22bace57ce8d4f49dfc0249", "ja": "楽しいんですけど、元気な子が多いので。\nちょっぴり大変かも……？　ふふっ。", "zh": "虽然很开心，但因为精力充沛的孩子比较多，可能会有点辛苦……？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "19bf0d0907c5cf2eb51a36f5e6c82d23575fa1f16c064d0bfcdcf3f620b6022d", "ja": "大変？", "zh": "很不容易吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "f450d259bcf037e9ceebb06937eedc9780df4358fcbd170597bffe5342c4f0e0", "ja": "はい。劇場にいると、毎日いろんな事が起こるんです。\n廊下を走る子がいたり、室内で球技をやる子がいたり。", "zh": "是的。待在剧场里，每天都会发生各种各样的事。\n有在走廊上跑的孩子，也有在室内进行球类运动的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "305df4e6a5ea7d8bf42ab13365b5f50b0a8139cebd5091abd53d617ad616c110", "ja": "それを注意していたら、後ろで全然違うことが\n起こってたり。なんだか、大忙しで。", "zh": "提醒着那些事情的时候，身后又会发生完全不同的事情。总觉得特别忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1009_p", "source_sha256": "70251e16a4a7d6d4c1c62df71d7592f44b341600d51a6c773507bc19e689177d", "ja": "個性的な子が多いからな……。みんなの面倒を\n見てくれてるみたいだけど、負担になってないか？", "zh": "个性十足的孩子很多啊……看起来你一直在照顾大家，会不会给你添负担？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "cdabfbbe4ad1596595a29cdb059009df07b14d864639bbc6cda53faf28062883", "ja": "大丈夫です。それに、劇場には私より年上の\n大人の方も多いですから……。", "zh": "没事的。而且，剧场里也有很多年纪比我大的\n成年人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "5e518e98cdfa86b478668b8ec66f280a1c896e44401584457e1c89c4e05dea2e", "ja": "みんなから、自分の知らない世界を\n教えてもらっている気がして、勉強になります。", "zh": "我感觉大家正在教我认识自己不了解的世界，真的让我学到了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1012_p", "source_sha256": "36fedfcf4f423a6ca353841bb24897b67d24de415707ad8e6d80437bd0cf00c3", "ja": "そうか。劇場での生活も、琴葉にとっては\n勉強になるのか……琴葉は真面目だな。", "zh": "这样啊。对琴叶来说，在剧场的生活也能学到东西啊……琴叶真是认真呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "667f1ebe09defb8a315dd95a5d3b6f520fa5d6532ebf03af0655b7547f51fabd", "ja": "え？　いえ、あの、\nそういうつもりじゃなくて……うう。", "zh": "诶？不、不是，我没那个意思……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ac065b751b59eec9626f3a58331c236b3ec4b78b1b5a9619d94d4774b7e852d2", "ja": "劇場の方は大丈夫そうだな。次は、仕事の話だけど……\n今後どうしていきたいとか、希望はあるか？", "zh": "剧场那边看来没问题了。接下来，说说工作的事……\n今后有什么打算，或者有什么希望吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1015_p", "source_sha256": "10171eab7094d3fb0e9b31d93393ad64c9a00bb98e35657b2168d583e02c03ec", "ja": "例えば、琴葉は演技が得意だけど、\nそれを活かした仕事を中心にしていきたいとか……。", "zh": "比如，琴叶擅长演戏，今后想主要接一些能发挥这项特长的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "a34c98a109e0e5cfbf63fe0b1a952e6deaca20f19595f39a618e25aa2509db88", "ja": "あっ……えっと。\nそうですね、演技も、ですけど……。", "zh": "啊……那个。\n是啊，演技也是，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "e38f1ca834f1bf20e53850e7c35bb70887d591dbe192fdd28738207d2db513bd", "ja": "あの……{$P$}。\n私、初公演の後……ファンレターをもらったんです。", "zh": "那个……{$P$}。\n我在首场公演之后……收到粉丝信了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4a9cac5afdb11b7bdde2e79a96f63247542a43bd7fbf82a0b55baa19cd22e846", "ja": "ああ、届いてたな。どうだった？", "zh": "啊，确实收到了。感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "2d53b4b1c3741411a6fc21a0f65cb97aaa5fcaa557f82a19e7885446397cf336", "ja": "はい！　私、ファンレターをもらうなんて\n初めてで……本当に、本当にうれしかったです！", "zh": "是的！我还是第一次收到粉丝来信……真的，真的特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "3d8d7bb3dd9c52ed76195ae13a0e71f7bac78c94a6167f9d854cd4b9d521eaf0", "ja": "アイドルになったばかりの私を、こんなふうに\n応援してくれる人がいるんだ、って。", "zh": "我就想着，原来真的有人会这样支持刚成为偶像的我啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "0bf1ee23d8b3d0b31bd1bd2424e13d2f14367452f1fce1f50d7eba50ae0499f7", "ja": "他の誰でもない、私を応援してくれる人がいるなら……\nその人たちのためにも、ステージに立ちたいです！", "zh": "如果有不是为了别人，而是专门支持我的人……\n我也想为了他们站上舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1022_p", "source_sha256": "926855f0ea7da61b32f55eebbb9bbb7044168b67009ffcd025733c7ac76cb113", "ja": "そうだな。琴葉自身は、どうだった？\n初めて、ステージに立ってみて……。", "zh": "是啊。琴叶自己觉得怎么样？\n第一次站上舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "333cef66611dc6d5205922f79554e9798ee68ff1ef60f56a06b8e45e8c1b4cf8", "ja": "私も、すごく楽しかったです。\n本番のステージは、私の想像を超えていました。", "zh": "我也觉得特别开心。\n正式演出时的舞台，超出了我的想象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "46456eceb8719424a64eef5176aead86613db20274c7a4182dacb2c117b67dc2", "ja": "お芝居は、もちろんやりたいです。でも、\nステージに立ちたい。もっと大きなステージにも……。", "zh": "演戏当然是想演的。不过，我想站上舞台。还想站上更大的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ebb3e75991ff86b8a788b752f5e30be69114f0691f4cdb5baaadce24efde424", "ja": "あの……{$P$}。\n私、欲張りでしょうか？　まだ新人なのに……。", "zh": "那个……{$P$}。\n我是不是太贪心了？明明还只是个新人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9849b0fb50a34155cb848cfd32680d81f4e547e7ac0fad11c50044bf04eddaed", "ja": "いや、それでいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "不，那样就挺好的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1027_p", "source_sha256": "da7e5ff14b6026dab3c15a68c52fce6326662b23bbc33388135dfab6edc6b17f", "ja": "色々な経験をした方が、幅が広がると思うよ。\nアイドルとしても、役者としても。", "zh": "我觉得还是多积累各种经验比较好，这样不管作为偶像还是演员，发展空间都会更广。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "6287751bbbe34f1e987bba8f0bc79121d70c81478f32a61f1bf00622ac044228", "ja": "{$P$}……\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "1537536b4b545ee2694423dc5186075dc8d993daf6a6bb48d8721ad9ea87bdb0", "ja": "もちろん、それだけ忙しくはなるけどな！\nとにかく色々チャレンジしてみる、って事でいいか？", "zh": "当然，相对的也会变忙就是了！\n总之就是什么都要挑战看看，这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "24b21def73e7f8117ad1f0d57201f89c6472e9760a54fb71d2fab4cb86d857ad", "ja": "はい！　あの……\nこれからも、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好的！那个……\n今后也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_004_1031_p", "source_sha256": "121c4a3b9e1e119625048bff2da496fc52d9cad454dbc57720f77cb8f964b746", "ja": "（琴葉が欲張りなのは、それだけ熱心って事だ。\nその願い、全て叶えられるといいな……！）", "zh": "（琴叶之所以贪心，正是因为她如此认真投入。\n希望能实现她所有的愿望……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
